WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.936 --> 00:00:04.437
- I'M TELLIN' YOU, VINNY,

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:07.273
NO DISRESPECT TO YOUR
DEARLY DEPARTED GRANDMOTHER,

00:00:07.306 --> 00:00:11.177
BUT MY AUNT MAKES
A PASTA--FORGET ABOUT IT.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.379
- YOUR AUNT LIVES
IN THIS NEIGHBORHOOD?

00:00:13.412 --> 00:00:16.082
SEEMS KINDA DANGEROUS.

00:00:16.115 --> 00:00:19.352
- WHAT ARE YOU,
MCGRUFF THE CRIME DOG?

00:00:19.385 --> 00:00:23.089
COME ON, WE'RE LATE ALREADY.

00:00:23.122 --> 00:00:26.459
- HEY, UH, YOU--YOU SAY
SHE LIVES IN THIS HOUSE HERE?

00:00:26.492 --> 00:00:28.694
- [bleep]'S THE MATTER
WITH YOU, VINNY?

00:00:28.727 --> 00:00:32.832
YOU'RE BEING RUDE.
LET'S GO.

00:00:32.865 --> 00:00:36.202
- I'M NOT TRYING
TO BE RUDE, IT'S--

00:00:36.235 --> 00:00:37.336
THE LIGHTS ARE OFF.

00:00:37.369 --> 00:00:40.206
MAYBE WE--
LET'S COME BACK LATER. Y--

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:42.341
- HEY, SHE'S PROBABLY
JUST TAKIN' A NAP

00:00:42.374 --> 00:00:44.310
AFTER THE HUGE MEAL
SHE JUST MADE FOR US.

00:00:44.343 --> 00:00:46.112
GO IN.

00:00:49.515 --> 00:00:50.783
- I DON'T HAVE THE KEY.

00:00:50.816 --> 00:00:52.251
YOU SHOULD GO IN FIRST.

00:00:52.284 --> 00:00:54.420
- OH, MARRONE, SHE SAID
SHE'D LEAVE IT OPEN.

00:00:54.453 --> 00:00:59.125
VINNY, STOP BEING
SUCH A STRUNZ AND GET IN THERE.

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:07.167
- ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT.

00:02:34.453 --> 00:02:37.157
- SURPRISE.

